From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ugur-imd <ugur.acikgoz@imd-tec.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 11:50:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] drivers: serial: serial_sh: exclude R9A09G056 (RZ/V2N)
 from HSSRR access

The RZ SoC family register-accessor block (which covers both
R9A09G056/imdt-v2n-sbc and R9A09G057/imdt-v2h-sbc) does not define
sci_HSSRR_out/sci_HSSRR_in - HSSRR is an HSCIF-only register not
present in this SCIF register layout. R9A09G057 is already excluded
from ever calling sci_out(port, HSSRR, ...); R9A09G056 was missing
from that same exclusion list, causing an undefined reference at
link time (and a segfault in the LTO linker while processing it).
---
 drivers/serial/serial_sh.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/serial/serial_sh.c b/drivers/serial/serial_sh.c
index 5bd8afb..8200942 100644
--- a/drivers/serial/serial_sh.c
+++ b/drivers/serial/serial_sh.c
@@ -60,7 +60,7 @@ static void sh_serial_init_generic(struct uart_port *port)
 #endif
 
 #if !(defined(CONFIG_R9A07G044L) || defined(CONFIG_R9A07G054L) || defined(CONFIG_R9A07G044C) || defined(CONFIG_R9A07G043U)  \
-|| defined(CONFIG_RZF_DEV) || defined(CONFIG_R9A09G057) || defined(CONFIG_R9A09G047))
+|| defined(CONFIG_RZF_DEV) || defined(CONFIG_R9A09G057) || defined(CONFIG_R9A09G056) || defined(CONFIG_R9A09G047))
 #if IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_RCAR_GEN2) || IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_RCAR_GEN3) || IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_RCAR_GEN4)
 	if (port->type == PORT_HSCIF)
 		sci_out(port, HSSRR, HSSRR_SRE | HSSRR_SRCYC8);
